# Vendored FPGA bitstream: a build artifact of //fpga/spi_ws281x, too big for git.
# Regenerate before deploying:
#   bazel build //fpga/spi_ws281x:spi_ws281x_tangnano9k
#   cp bazel-bin/fpga/spi_ws281x/spi_ws281x_tangnano9k.fs \
#      pi/provisioning/nix/fpga/spi_ws281x.fs
# TODO: build the bitstream in Nix (rules_fpga toolchain is Nix-vendored) so a
# fresh checkout deploys without this manual step.
*.fs
